Module100450Name=POS Floor &amp; Table Manager
Module100450Desc=Fixes TakePos table/floor numbering: per-floor uniqueness, automatic numbering, floor management screen

PosFloorManagerMenu=Floors &amp; Tables
PosFloorManagerTitle=POS floors, rooms and tables management
PosFloorManagerSetup=Setup - POS Floor &amp; Table Manager
PosFloorManagerSetupDesc=This module fixes table/floor numbering of the native TakePos module, without modifying any core file.
PosFloorManagerHowItWorks=How it works: on activation, this module installs 2 triggers on the TakePos technical table (llx_takepos_floor_tables) and replaces the native global table-number uniqueness constraint with a per-floor constraint. Any table created or renamed - whether from the native TakePos screen or from this module's screen - now gets clean, sequential, per-floor numbering.
PosFloorManagerOpenScreen=Open management screen

PosFloorManagerIntro=Manage your floor/room names and table numbering here. The visual floor plan (drag and drop) is still managed from the native TakePos "Edit" screen; this screen ensures numbering stays clean wherever a table is created or renamed.

